From: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Feb 2024 18:38:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 362/913] dts: stm32mp15: describe cpu power supply on
 stm32mp15 boards

Describe cpu power supply on stm32mp15 boards that
is used for CPU OPP.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git ea0d200c97b9fe7754d0d6b84e3b157bb69543df dts: stm32mp15: describe cpu power supply on stm32mp15 boards]
Change-Id: I6e91746a0880f20d82e02563585faacd8ecf72b4
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/362691
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/561942
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp157c-ed1.dts  | 8 ++++++++
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xx-dkx.dtsi | 8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp157c-ed1.dts b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp157c-ed1.dts
index 8e056a1aa..3edb9b399 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp157c-ed1.dts
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp157c-ed1.dts
@@ -130,6 +130,14 @@
 	st,digbypass;
 };
 
+&cpu0{
+	cpu-supply = <&vddcore>;
+};
+
+&cpu1{
+	cpu-supply = <&vddcore>;
+};
+
 &crc1 {
 	status = "disabled";
 };
diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xx-dkx.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xx-dkx.dtsi
index 163fec387..c9a59a2db 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xx-dkx.dtsi
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xx-dkx.dtsi
@@ -250,6 +250,14 @@
 	st,digbypass;
 };
 
+&cpu0{
+	cpu-supply = <&vddcore>;
+};
+
+&cpu1{
+	cpu-supply = <&vddcore>;
+};
+
 &i2c4 {
 	compatible = "st,stm32mp15-i2c-non-secure";
 	pinctrl-names = "default", "sleep";
-- 
